OL,3,GNEWSAKeeping London's canal boats
OL,4,Aafloat during drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrought conditions in the capital mean
OL,7,Fthat London's waterways are being more
OL,8,Factively managed to maintain water
OL,9,Flevels.
OL,11,FIn west London on the Grand Union
OL,12,FCanal, the gates of six locks known as
OL,13,Fthe Hanwell Flight have been locked up
OL,14,Fat night with their paddles shut to
OL,15,Fprevent misuse that impacts the canal
OL,16,Fdownstream.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32502
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1787547353
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKeeping London's canal boats
OL,4,Aafloat during drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FColin Beesley, waterway operative at
OL,7,FCanal and River Trust, described the
OL,8,Fsituation as "unprecedented", adding:
OL,9,F"It's been one of the driest summers
OL,10,Fwe've ever seen and of course there's
OL,11,Fbeen virtually no rain.
OL,13,F"Because this drought has been
OL,14,Fextending for so long, we've made the
OL,15,Fdecision to lock this flight of locks
OL,16,Fovernight."
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
